sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna
    participant View as "Web View (auth.login)"
    participant C as LoginController
    participant U as "User Model"
    participant W as "Worker Model"
    participant D as "Department Model"
    participant A as "AuditLog Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pengguna->>View: Isi login + password, submit form POST /login
    View->>C: login(login, password, remember_me)

    C->>C: Validasi LoginRequest + autentikasi kredensial
    C->>U: Cari user by email/username dan cek password/is_active
    U->>DB: SELECT users + verifikasi hash + status akun
    DB-->>U: Hasil cek user

    alt Data valid
        C->>DB: Auth::attempt + create session
        C->>U: Update last_login + load relasi worker/department/roles
        U->>DB: UPDATE users.last_login + SELECT relasi
        C->>A: Simpan audit login
        A->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs(action='login', user_id, ...)
        C-->>View: Redirect intended sesuai role
        View-->>Pengguna: Masuk ke dashboard
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + pesan gagal login
        View-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan error
    end
